# GraphQL and Prisma

Register domain schema in `modules/<domain>/` and merge in `lib/graphql`. Use connection pagination (`edges`, `pageInfo`). Hide fields the current role must not see.

Throw typed errors (`AuthenticationError`, `AuthorizationError`, `ValidationError`, `NotFoundError`, `ConflictError`, `BusinessRuleError`). Do not leak stack traces to clients.

Scope Prisma `where` by `organizationId`. Add composite indexes for tenant filters (`organizationId + status`, `organizationId + createdAt`). Use `select` to avoid over-fetching. No `any` unless unavoidable.
